---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { business } from '../lib/site';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy | Bhuk Lagla Kitchen"
  description="How Bhuk Lagla Kitchen handles contact enquiries, optional journey measurement and links to Zomato."
>
  <article class="wrap prose section">
    <p class="eyebrow">Updated 9 October 2026</p>
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <h2>Contact enquiries</h2>
    <p>
      When you send the form, your name, email, message and any optional phone or event details are
      sent directly to Web3Forms and delivered to the kitchen’s email account. We use them to reply
      and discuss your enquiry. Please do not include payment or sensitive personal details.
    </p>
    <p>
      Web3Forms processes submissions under its{' '}
      <a href="https://web3forms.com/privacy" rel="noopener" target="_blank">
        privacy policy
      </a>
      . The kitchen retains enquiry emails only while needed for the conversation and any agreed
      arrangements. You can email {business.email} to request access or deletion, subject to records
      we must retain.
    </p>
    <h2>Optional anonymous journey measurement</h2>
    <p>
      Measurement is off unless you choose to allow it. If allowed, we create a random session
      identifier for the current browser session and record page, category and dish views, menu
      filter use, Zomato link clicks and browser-reported successful enquiries. We do not record
      names, email addresses, phone numbers, typed search terms or precise locations in journey
      events.
    </p>
    <p>
      These events may produce a notification for the kitchen containing a short anonymous journey.
      Notifications use ntfy. The notification topic has an unguessable address, but is not an
      access-controlled private channel, so contact details are excluded. Our journey service
      retains events for up to 30 days. Network addresses are used only to enforce rate limits;
      rate-limit identifiers are hashed.
    </p>
    <p>
      A Zomato click does not tell us whether you completed an order. Browser-reported form success
      is not independently verified by the journey service.
    </p>
    <button class="button secondary" data-privacy-settings>
      Change measurement choice
    </button>
    <h2>Local storage and offline use</h2>
    <p>
      The website stores your measurement choice and, if installed or cached, public website files
      for offline browsing. The cached menu may be older than Zomato’s live menu. You cannot order
      from Zomato while offline.
    </p>
    <h2>Zomato and other links</h2>
    <p>
      Zomato controls its own account, delivery, payment and offer information under its policies.
      We do not receive your Zomato order status through this website.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Bhuk Lagla Kitchen, Sundargarh, Odisha. Email{' '}
      <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
